 "remarks": "Welcome to Sound View Towers. This amazing complex provides new homeowners with exceptional lifestyle plus conveniences of being close to all local downtown amenities. The open floor plan flows effortlessly highlighting generous rooms, modern finishes with new hardwood floors, newer kitchen and newer baths. Spacious living room with slider to a private balcony, two bedrooms and 2 full baths. The dining room is a special place to enjoy with all of dining gathering. The balcony, a great place to relax in all seasons. This move-in ready second level unit offers easy condominium living at its best. Fantastic community amenities including concierge service, stylish lobby, fitness center with sauna and indoor garage space. The Homeowners Assoc.includes Heat, Hot Water, cooking gas, all indoor and outdoor maintenance. Laundry room is located on every floor. This sought-after Glenbrook neighborhood and only minutes to Train Station and downtown Stamford - A must see!!",
